---
interface Props { data:any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="words-experience">
    <div class="top">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="crumb"><b>Estudio</b> &nbsp;/&nbsp; Contador de palabras</div>
        <div class="intro"><div><div class="eyebrow">Herramienta de escritura</div><h1>Contá palabras mientras escribís</h1><p>Pegá tu trabajo y mirá al instante cuánto llevás, cuánto falta y cómo se lee.</p></div><div class="privacy">🔒 Tu texto no sale de este navegador</div></div>
        <div class="app">
          <div class="appbar"><div class="dots"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="app-title">Mi trabajo práctico</div><span class="live">● CONTEO EN VIVO</span></div>
          <div class="editor-grid">
            <div class="editor">
	              <div class="editor-tools"><button class="mini" id="words-paste" type="button">Pegar texto</button><button class="mini" id="words-import" type="button">Importar .txt</button><input id="words-file" type="file" accept=".txt,text/plain" hidden><button class="mini" id="words-copy" type="button">Copiar</button><button class="mini clear" id="clear" type="button">Vaciar</button></div>
              <div class="paper"><textarea id="text">La escritura académica exige precisión, claridad y una estructura que permita seguir el argumento principal. Cada párrafo debe defender una idea y respaldarla con evidencia relevante.

El desarrollo contrasta distintas posturas de la bibliografía y explica por qué algunas interpretaciones resultan más sólidas que otras. Una buena conclusión no repite: integra los hallazgos y responde la pregunta inicial.

Pegá tu propio texto para reemplazar este ejemplo. El conteo se actualiza mientras escribís y también respeta los saltos de línea.</textarea></div>
            </div>
            <aside class="side">
              <h2>Resumen del texto</h2>
              <div class="primary">
	                <div class="stat main"><small>PALABRAS</small><strong id="words">74</strong><em id="words-goal-caption">de 3.000 palabras</em></div>
                <div class="stat"><small>CARACTERES</small><strong id="chars">494</strong><em>con espacios</em></div>
                <div class="stat"><small>PÁGINAS</small><strong id="pages">0,3</strong><em>doble espacio</em></div>
                <div class="stat"><small>PÁRRAFOS</small><strong id="paras">3</strong></div>
                <div class="stat"><small>LECTURA</small><strong id="read">22 s</strong><em>en silencio</em></div>
              </div>
	              <div class="goal"><div class="goal-head"><span>Objetivo del trabajo</span><strong id="words-goal-title">3.000 palabras</strong></div><div class="bar"><i id="progress" style="width:2.5%"></i></div><div class="goal-foot"><span id="percent">2,5% completo</span><span id="missing">Faltan 2.926</span></div></div>
	              <div class="settings"><label class="setting"><small>INTERLINEADO</small><select id="words-spacing"><option value="250">Doble · APA</option><option value="375">1,5 líneas</option><option value="500">Simple</option></select></label><label class="setting"><small>TAMAÑO</small><select id="words-size"><option>11</option><option selected>12</option><option>14</option></select></label><label class="setting"><small>OBJETIVO</small><input id="words-goal" type="number" min="0" step="100" value="3000"></label><label class="setting"><small>TIPO DE TEXTO</small><select id="words-type"><option>Académico</option><option>Discurso</option><option>Artículo</option><option>Ensayo</option></select></label></div>
	              <button class="done" id="words-analyze" type="button">Analizar mi texto</button>
            </aside>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section>
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="center"><div class="kicker">MÁS QUE CONTAR</div><h2 class="title">Entendé cómo se lee tu texto</h2><p class="sub">Una segunda mirada a la estructura, el ritmo y el tiempo que necesita quien lo lee.</p></div>
        <div class="analysis">
	          <div class="card" id="words-analysis"><h3>Legibilidad Fernández Huerta</h3><div class="score-top"><div class="score"><b id="words-score">67</b></div><div class="score-copy"><b id="words-level">Lectura normal</b><p>El índice combina longitud de oraciones y sílabas por palabra. Sirve como orientación, no como nota.</p></div></div><div class="read-bar"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></div><div class="read-labels"><span>Muy fácil</span><span>Normal</span><span>Difícil</span><span>Muy difícil</span></div><div class="tip">💡 <b>Oportunidad:</b> revisá las oraciones largas si querés que el argumento sea más fácil de seguir.</div></div>
	          <div class="card"><h3>Estructura del texto</h3><div class="rows"><div class="row"><div class="icon">¶</div><span>Párrafos</span><b id="words-detail-paras">3</b></div><div class="row"><div class="icon">.</div><span>Oraciones</span><b id="words-detail-sentences">7</b></div><div class="row"><div class="icon">Aa</div><span>Promedio por oración</span><b id="words-detail-average">10,6 palabras</b></div><div class="row"><div class="icon">◷</div><span>Lectura en voz alta</span><b id="words-detail-read">34 segundos</b></div><div class="row"><div class="icon">⌨</div><span>Tipear lo que falta</span><b id="words-detail-type">1 h 13 min</b></div><div class="row"><div class="icon">▤</div><span>Fuentes sugeridas</span><b id="words-detail-sources">12 aprox.</b></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="rules">
      <div class="wrap">
        <div class="kicker">ANTES DE ENTREGAR</div><h2 class="title">¿Qué entra en el conteo?</h2><p class="sub">La consigna de tu cátedra manda. Este es el criterio más habitual en trabajos académicos.</p>
        <div class="rules-grid">
          <div class="rule"><h3>Normalmente sí cuenta</h3><div class="checklist"><div class="check"><i>✓</i><span>Introducción, desarrollo y conclusión</span></div><div class="check"><i>✓</i><span>Citas textuales dentro de los párrafos</span></div><div class="check"><i>✓</i><span>Títulos y subtítulos del cuerpo</span></div><div class="check"><i>✓</i><span>Notas al pie sustantivas, si la cátedra las incluye</span></div></div></div>
          <div class="rule"><h3>Normalmente no cuenta</h3><div class="checklist"><div class="check no"><i>×</i><span>Carátula e índice</span></div><div class="check no"><i>×</i><span>Resumen o abstract</span></div><div class="check no"><i>×</i><span>Referencias bibliográficas</span></div><div class="check no"><i>×</i><span>Anexos, tablas y figuras</span></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="note"><div class="lock">🔒</div><div><b>Tu trabajo es privado</b><p>Todo el análisis ocurre en tu dispositivo. El texto no se guarda ni se envía a ningún servidor.</p></div><a>Cómo hacemos el conteo →</a></div>
      </div>
	    </section>
      <section class="support wrap"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><aside><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}<small>{s.publisher}</small></a>)}</aside></section>
	  </div>
	<script is:inline>
	    (()=>{const $=id=>document.getElementById(id),t=$("text"),dur=min=>min<1?Math.max(1,Math.round(min*60))+" segundos":min<60?Math.round(min)+" min":Math.floor(min/60)+" h "+Math.round(min%60)+" min",syllable=w=>(w.toLowerCase().match(/[aeiouáéíóúüy]+/g)||[1]).length;
	    function count(){const s=t.value,list=s.trim()?s.trim().split(/\s+/):[],w=list.length,p=s.trim()?s.split(/\n\s*\n/).filter(x=>x.trim()).length:0,c=s.length,sent=Math.max(s.trim()?1:0,s.split(/[.!?…]+/).filter(x=>x.trim()).length),goal=Math.max(0,Number($("words-goal").value)||0),ppg=Number($("words-spacing").value)*(12/(Number($("words-size").value)||12)),pages=w/ppg,missing=Math.max(0,goal-w),pc=goal?Math.min(100,w/goal*100):w?100:0,totalSyll=list.reduce((a,x)=>a+syllable(x),0),score=w&&sent?Math.max(0,Math.min(100,206.84-60*(totalSyll/w)-1.02*(w/sent))):0,level=score>=80?"Lectura fácil":score>=60?"Lectura normal":score>=50?"Lectura algo difícil":"Lectura difícil";
	    $("words").textContent=w.toLocaleString("es-AR");$("chars").textContent=c.toLocaleString("es-AR");$("pages").textContent=pages.toFixed(1).replace(".",",");$("paras").textContent=p;$("read").textContent=dur(w/200);$("progress").style.width=pc+"%";$("percent").textContent=pc.toFixed(1).replace(".",",")+"% completo";$("missing").textContent=missing?"Faltan "+missing.toLocaleString("es-AR"):"Objetivo cumplido";$("words-goal-caption").textContent="de "+goal.toLocaleString("es-AR")+" palabras";$("words-goal-title").textContent=goal.toLocaleString("es-AR")+" palabras";$("words-score").textContent=Math.round(score);$("words-level").textContent=level;document.querySelector(".score").style.background=`conic-gradient(var(--green) 0 ${score}%,#e8edf2 ${score}%)`;$("words-detail-paras").textContent=p;$("words-detail-sentences").textContent=sent;$("words-detail-average").textContent=(sent?w/sent:0).toFixed(1).replace(".",",")+" palabras";$("words-detail-read").textContent=dur(w/130);$("words-detail-type").textContent=dur(missing/40);$("words-detail-sources").textContent=Math.max(0,Math.round(goal/250))+" aprox."}
	    t.addEventListener("input",count);["words-goal","words-spacing","words-size"].forEach(id=>$(id).addEventListener("input",count));$("clear").onclick=()=>{t.value="";count();t.focus()};$("words-copy").onclick=async()=>{await navigator.clipboard.writeText(t.value);$("words-copy").textContent="Copiado ✓";setTimeout(()=>$("words-copy").textContent="Copiar",1200)};$("words-paste").onclick=async()=>{try{t.value=await navigator.clipboard.readText();count()}catch{t.focus()}};$("words-import").onclick=()=>$("words-file").click();$("words-file").onchange=()=>{const f=$("words-file").files[0];if(!f)return;const r=new FileReader();r.onload=()=>{t.value=String(r.result||"");count()};r.readAsText(f)};$("words-analyze").onclick=()=>{$("words-analysis").scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"center"})};count()})();
	  </script>
<style>
	    *{box-sizing:border-box}:root{--ink:#10213d;--muted:#61738d;--line:#dbe4ee;--blue:#326de5;--violet:#7751db;--violet2:#f1edff;--green:#28a67a;--yellow:#f8bd4c;--bg:#f6f8fc}.words-experience{width:100%;overflow:hidden}
    body{margin:0;font-family:Manrope,system-ui,sans-serif;color:var(--ink);background:#fff}button,input,textarea,select{font:inherit}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}
    header{height:88px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;background:#fff}.head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:44px}.brand{font-size:20px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.logo{width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:9px;background:#183553;color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:13px}nav{display:flex;gap:30px;font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#344760;flex:1;justify-content:center}.tools{display:flex;gap:10px}.tool{padding:11px 15px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:#fff;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}.tool.dark{background:#163352;color:#fff;border-color:#163352}
    .top{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f7f9ff 0,#f9f7ff 55%,#f3fbf8 100%);padding:28px 0 60px}.crumb{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:28px}.crumb b{color:var(--blue)}.intro{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin-bottom:30px}.eyebrow{font-size:10px;color:var(--violet);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}.intro h1{font-size:43px;letter-spacing:-2px;margin:12px 0 8px}.intro p{font-size:16px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}.privacy{background:#e9f8f2;color:#167a5c;border-radius:12px;padding:11px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:800}
    .app{background:#fff;border:1px solid #d6e0ea;border-radius:23px;box-shadow:0 24px 65px rgba(32,55,91,.12);overflow:hidden}.appbar{height:55px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 20px;gap:10px}.dots{display:flex;gap:6px;margin-right:8px}.dots i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#d7deea}.app-title{font-size:12px;font-weight:800}.live{margin-left:auto;background:#edf9f5;color:var(--green);border-radius:999px;padding:7px 10px;font-size:9px;font-weight:800}.editor-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.55fr .85fr}.editor{padding:24px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}.editor-tools{display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:14px}.mini{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:9px;padding:8px 10px;font-size:10px;color:#50627b;font-weight:700}.mini.clear{margin-left:auto;color:#d05b60}.paper{position:relative}.paper textarea{width:100%;height:390px;resize:none;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:16px;background:#fcfdff;padding:26px;font-family:"Source Serif 4",serif;font-size:17px;line-height:1.75;color:#263751;outline:none}.paper textarea:focus{border-color:#8b6de0;box-shadow:0 0 0 4px #f0ebff}.cursor{position:absolute;left:249px;top:64px;width:2px;height:24px;background:var(--violet)}
	    .side{padding:24px;background:#fbfcfe}.side h2{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 17px}.primary{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:10px}.stat{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:13px;padding:14px;background:#fff}.stat.main{grid-column:span 2;background:#183a5a;color:#fff;border-color:#183a5a}.stat small{display:block;font-size:9px;color:#71839a}.stat.main small{color:#c8d8e5}.stat strong{display:block;font-size:23px;margin-top:4px}.stat.main strong{font-size:31px}.stat em{font-style:normal;font-size:9px;color:#8393a7}.goal{margin-top:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:15px;background:#fff}.goal-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;font-size:10px}.goal-head strong{font-size:13px}.bar{height:10px;background:#edf0f5;border-radius:20px;margin:12px 0 8px;overflow:hidden}.bar i{display:block;width:68%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--violet),#a77ce9);border-radius:20px}.goal-foot{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;color:var(--muted)}.settings{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px;margin-top:13px}.setting{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:10px;background:#fff}.setting small{font-size:8px;color:var(--muted);display:block}.setting input,.setting select{font-size:10px;display:block;margin-top:4px;width:100%;border:0;background:transparent;outline:0;color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}.done{width:100%;margin-top:13px;border:0;border-radius:11px;background:var(--violet);color:#fff;font-weight:800;padding:13px}
    section{padding:72px 0}.center{text-align:center}.kicker{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--violet);font-weight:800}.title{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-1.4px;margin:13px 0}.sub{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}.analysis{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:18px;margin-top:38px}.card{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px}.card h3{font-size:18px;margin:0 0 18px}.score-top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:17px}.score{width:82px;height:82px;border-radius:50%;background:conic-gradient(var(--green) 0 67%,#e8edf2 67%);display:grid;place-items:center;position:relative}.score:after{content:"";position:absolute;width:61px;height:61px;background:white;border-radius:50%}.score b{position:relative;z-index:1;font-size:20px}.score-copy b{font-size:15px}.score-copy p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;margin:5px 0}.read-bar{display:grid;grid-template-columns:20% 25% 30% 25%;height:9px;gap:2px;margin:20px 0 7px}.read-bar i{border-radius:5px}.read-bar i:nth-child(1){background:#79cdaa}.read-bar i:nth-child(2){background:#b7d96c}.read-bar i:nth-child(3){background:#f4c75f}.read-bar i:nth-child(4){background:#e88072}.read-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:8px;color:var(--muted)}.tip{margin-top:18px;padding:13px;background:#fff8e9;border:1px solid #f3d48a;border-radius:12px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.55;color:#74561b}
    .rows{display:grid;gap:10px}.row{display:flex;align-items:center;padding-bottom:10px;border-bottom:1px solid #edf1f5}.row:last-child{border:0}.row .icon{width:33px;height:33px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--violet2);display:grid;place-items:center;margin-right:10px}.row span{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.row b{margin-left:auto;font-size:13px}
	    .rules{background:#f4f2fb}.rules-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;margin-top:36px}.rule{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:24px}.rule h3{font-size:17px;margin:0 0 17px}.checklist{display:grid;gap:12px}.check{display:flex;gap:10px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.45;color:#52647e}.check i{font-style:normal;width:22px;height:22px;flex:0 0 22px;border-radius:7px;display:grid;place-items:center;background:#e8f8f2;color:var(--green);font-weight:800}.check.no i{background:#fff0ed;color:#db685f}.note{margin-top:28px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;padding:18px 22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px}.note .lock{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;display:grid;place-items:center;background:var(--violet2);font-size:19px}.note b{font-size:12px}.note p{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin:4px 0 0}.note a{margin-left:auto;color:var(--violet);font-size:10px;font-weight:800}.support{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr;gap:40px;padding:70px 0}.support h2{font-size:24px}.support details{border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed;padding:14px 0}.support summary{font-size:12px;font-weight:750;cursor:pointer}.support p{font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;color:#687a8f}.support a{display:block;border:1px solid #dce5ee;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;color:var(--violet);text-decoration:none;font-size:10px;font-weight:700}.support small{display:block;color:#78899c;margin-top:4px}
	    @media(max-width:800px){nav,.tools{display:none}.intro{display:block}.privacy{display:inline-block;margin-top:18px}.editor-grid,.analysis,.rules-grid,.support{grid-template-columns:1fr}.editor{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}}
  </style>
